# The tools' raw files (~470 MB of third-party data), as a folder or a link to
# one. Their provenance goes in instead: sources/MANIFEST.csv carries a SHA-256,
# a DOI or URL and, where it was recorded, a retrieval date for every one of the
# 34 files.
raw_sources

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.claude/

# R opens a default device when a script draws outside png().
Rplots.pdf

# Superseded logs, the old draft figure and transfer bundles. The repository
# carries one figure and the code that makes it.
archive/

# The matplotlib rendering of the same matrix: a cross-check the pipeline draws
# on every run, not the publication figure. host_general_scheme_R.png is.
host_general_scheme.png

# Scratch tables sweep_threshold.py writes and deletes on every run.
scripts/_sweep_*
